			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Propagate Air request ID consolidation\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to ba1a234e, which integrates the Air submodule advancement (566a3367) that consolidates request ID generation.\n\nAir removes the local `GenerateRequestID` module in favor of direct delegation to the shared `GenerateRequestId()` utility function, mirroring the refactor previously applied in Mountain. This eliminates redundant indirection and ensures a single source of truth for request ID generation across both sidecars.\n\nThe Element update synchronizes Mountain and Cocoon compiled artifacts with this Air change, maintaining consistency across the IPC boundary implementations.",
